---
/*
 * Interactive mock of Kassiber's "Add connection" dialog, ported from the app's
 * ui-tauri/src/components/kb/AddConnectionDialog.tsx and its catalog,
 * ui-tauri/src/lib/connectionCatalog.tsx (v0.22.78, developer tools off, so
 * the unfinished Core Lightning and LND cards stay hidden). App dark-theme
 * values are copied literally, so the panel reads as the app.
 *
 * The dialog has the command palette's treatment: a category rail, a bare
 * search row over one-line source rows, and a detail pane that carries each
 * source's description and setup notes. All three work here: the rail swaps
 * the list, the search filters every category at once, and a row opens its
 * details. Only Cancel and Continue are inert.
 *
 * Logos are the app's own integration assets, with its treatments: hardware-
 * wallet glyphs are near-black and get inverted to white, Bitpanda sits on its
 * brand green, and sources without a mark keep the app's generated tiles. ZEUS
 * and Phoenix keep their real logos from the projects' own repos, where the
 * app falls back to a bolt and a "PHX" tile.
 */
